//! 🧪️ Committed vector `➕️insert-tower-leg` / `⛔dupe`: re-applying the op to the after-snapshot it already produced is refused with `mutation.duplicate-id` (fatal) and leaves the document untouched.
use crate::{En1993Diff, En1993Mutation, En1993Snapshot};
const BEFORE: &str = include_str!("../../../../../🧫️fixtures/🧬️mutations/➕️insert-tower-leg/⛔dupe/📸️snapshot/⬅️before/🔣️.json");
